 "method": "Method (measured on the CadQuery solids, converted with the slicer): for every printed geometry step the module is built twice - the VTOL configuration with and without that one override (params deep copy, everything else equal) - and the solid-volume difference is converted to printed grams with that module's effective density in the VTOL slicer table (part grams / solid volume of the exact sliced solid).  Steps that remove whole parts / placeholders are read from the CAD reports (rocket vs VTOL battery).  The sum of the steps is compared with the reports' total difference; the residual (interaction between steps, e.g. the windows on the shorter tube) is reported, not hidden."
